<%- include('partials/header') %>
<body class="banking-workspace"><div class="app-layout"><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><main class="main-content workspace-main">
<p class="workspace-eyebrow">YOUR WILLOW / A NEW ACCOUNT</p><div class="page-header"><a href="/accounts">← Your accounts</a><h1>A place for your next plan.</h1><p>Choose a demo account. Every new account starts at $0.00 USD, with no real deposits, fees or credit application.</p></div>
<% if (accountCount >= 10) { %><section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>You've reached the demo account limit</h2><p>Each profile can hold up to 10 accounts.</p><a href="/accounts">View your accounts →</a></div></section><% } else { %>
<form id="openAccountForm"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>">
<fieldset class="account-product-options"><legend>1. Choose your account</legend>
<% [['checking','Checking','For everyday spending','Use simulated deposits, withdrawals, transfers and statements.'],['savings','Savings','For future plans','Keep a separate demo balance for saving. No interest is accrued.'],['business','Business checking','For your working day','Separate simulated business funds. Single owner; no payroll, lending or merchant processing.']].forEach(([value,title,subtitle,description]) => { %><label class="account-product"><input type="radio" name="product" value="<%= value %>" <%= product === value ? 'checked' : '' %> required><span><strong><%= title %></strong><span class="account-product-subtitle"><%= subtitle %></span><span><%= description %></span></span></label><% }) %>
</fieldset>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>2. Make it yours</h2><div class="form-group mt-4"><label for="newAccountName">Account name (optional)</label><input type="text" class="form-control" name="nickname" id="newAccountName" maxlength="40" placeholder="For example, Everyday spending" aria-describedby="newAccountHelp"><p class="form-hint" id="newAccountHelp">Up to 40 characters. You can rename it later.</p></div>
<p class="text-muted mb-4">Your account belongs to this profile. No additional debit card is issued automatically. Existing accounts and balances stay unchanged.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Review account</button></div></section>
</form>
<section class="card mt-6" id="accountOpeningReview" hidden aria-labelledby="accountOpeningTitle" tabindex="-1"><div class="card-body"><h2 id="accountOpeningTitle">Review your new demo account</h2><dl class="transfer-summary"><div><dt>Account type</dt><dd id="openingProduct"></dd></div><div><dt>Account name</dt><dd id="openingName"></dd></div><div><dt>Starting balance</dt><dd>$0.00 USD</dd></div></dl><p>No real bank account is opened. Business checking has no company verification, additional users or real business services.</p><label class="opening-acknowledgement"><input type="checkbox" id="openingAcknowledged"> I understand this account and its funds are simulated.</label><div class="settings-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="editOpening">Edit choice</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="confirmOpening">Open demo account</button></div></div></section>
<p id="openingFeedback" class="settings-feedback" role="status" tabindex="-1" hidden></p><% } %>
</main></div><script src="/js/open-account.js" defer></script><%- include('partials/footer') %>
